<title>MEXICO: Elektra says opens stores in El Salvador.</title>
<headline>Elektra says opens stores in El Salvador.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexican retail chain Grupo Elektra (Elektra) said Thursday it began operations in El Salvador with the opening of four Mega Elektra stores.</p>
<p>&quot;The beginning of operations in El Salvador means that Elektra continues with a strong step its expansion into Central and South America,&quot; the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>In April, Elektra opened stores in Guatemala. The company aims to reach a total of 40 stores outside Mexico by the end of 1997, with expansion also planned in Honduras and the Dominican Republic.</p>
<p>((--Karina Balderas, Mexico newsroom +525 728-9562))</p>
